{"schema":"s10y-choice-draft-v1","questions":[{"view":{"mode":"multiple","stem":"下列关于有限数列及其公比的判断，哪些成立？选出全部成立的判断。","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$1000,100,10,1,0.1$ 是等比数列，公比为 $\\frac{1}{10}$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$0.1,0.01,0.001,0.0001$ 是等比数列，公比为 $\\frac{1}{10}$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$\\frac{1}{16},\\frac{1}{8},\\frac{1}{2},2,8,16$ 是等比数列，公比为 $4$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$-1,10,-100,1000,-10000$ 是等比数列，公比为 $-10$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"E","text":"$1,1.1,1.11,1.111$ 是等比数列，公比为 $1.1$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"F","text":"$5^{-2},5^{-1},5^0,5^1,5^2$ 是等比数列，公比为 $5$。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"等比数列 $(b_n)$ 的首项为 $b_1=6$，公比为 $q=2$。它的前五项依次是哪一组？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$6,8,10,12,14$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$12,24,48,96,192$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$6,12,24,48,96$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$6,3,\\frac{3}{2},\\frac{3}{4},\\frac{3}{8}$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"等比数列 $(b_n)$ 的首项为 $b_1=-16$，公比为 $q=\\frac{1}{2}$。它的前五项依次是哪一组？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$-16,-8,-4,-2,-1$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$-16,-\\frac{31}{2},-15,-\\frac{29}{2},-14$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$-16,-32,-64,-128,-256$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$-16,8,-4,2,-1$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"等比数列 $(b_n)$ 的首项为 $b_1=\\frac{3}{4}$，公比为 $q=-\\frac{2}{3}$。它的前五项依次是哪一组？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$\\frac{3}{4},\\frac{1}{2},\\frac{1}{3},\\frac{2}{9},\\frac{4}{27}$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$\\frac{3}{4},-\\frac{9}{8},\\frac{27}{16},-\\frac{81}{32},\\frac{243}{64}$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$\\frac{3}{4},\\frac{1}{12},-\\frac{7}{12},-\\frac{5}{4},-\\frac{23}{12}$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$\\frac{3}{4},-\\frac{1}{2},\\frac{1}{3},-\\frac{2}{9},\\frac{4}{27}$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"等比数列 $(b_n)$ 的首项为 $b_1=-24$，公比为 $q=-1.5$。它的前五项依次是哪一组？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$-24,-36,-54,-81,-\\frac{243}{2}$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$-24,36,-54,81,-\\frac{243}{2}$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$-24,-\\frac{51}{2},-27,-\\frac{57}{2},-30$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$-24,16,-\\frac{32}{3},\\frac{64}{9},-\\frac{128}{27}$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"等比数列 $(b_n)$ 的首项为 $b_1=0.4$，公比为 $q=\\sqrt{2}$。它的前五项依次是哪一组？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$\\frac{2}{5},\\frac{4}{5},\\frac{8}{5},\\frac{16}{5},\\frac{32}{5}$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$\\frac{2}{5},\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{5},\\frac{1}{5},\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{10},\\frac{1}{10}$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$\\frac{2}{5},\\frac{2\\sqrt{2}}{5},\\frac{4}{5},\\frac{4\\sqrt{2}}{5},\\frac{8}{5}$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$\\frac{2}{5},\\frac{2\\sqrt{2}}{5},\\frac{2}{5},\\frac{2\\sqrt{2}}{5},\\frac{2}{5}$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"等比数列 $(b_n)$ 的首项为 $b_1=1.8$，公比为 $q=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}$。它的前五项依次是哪一组？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$\\frac{9}{5},\\frac{3\\sqrt{3}}{5},\\frac{3}{5},\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{5},\\frac{1}{5}$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$\\frac{9}{5},\\frac{9\\sqrt{3}}{5},\\frac{27}{5},\\frac{27\\sqrt{3}}{5},\\frac{81}{5}$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$\\frac{9}{5},\\frac{3}{5},\\frac{1}{5},\\frac{1}{15},\\frac{1}{45}$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$\\frac{9}{5},\\frac{3\\sqrt{3}}{5},\\frac{1}{5},\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{15},\\frac{1}{45}$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"一个等比数列的前两项依次为 $3,15$。它的公比 $q$ 和第四项 $b_4$ 是哪一组？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$q=5,\\quad b_4=375$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$q=\\frac{1}{5},\\quad b_4=\\frac{3}{125}$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$q=5,\\quad b_4=75$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$q=5,\\quad b_4=1875$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"一个等比数列的前两项依次为 $15,3$。它的公比 $q$ 和第四项 $b_4$ 是哪一组？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$q=\\frac{1}{5},\\quad b_4=\\frac{3}{5}$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$q=5,\\quad b_4=1875$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$q=\\frac{1}{5},\\quad b_4=\\frac{3}{25}$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$q=\\frac{1}{5},\\quad b_4=\\frac{3}{125}$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"一个等比数列的前两项依次为 $6,-12$。它的公比 $q$ 和第四项 $b_4$ 是哪一组？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$q=2,\\quad b_4=48$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$q=-2,\\quad b_4=-48$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$q=-\\frac{1}{2},\\quad b_4=-\\frac{3}{4}$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$q=-2,\\quad b_4=24$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"一个等比数列的前两项依次为 $-20,-10$。它的公比 $q$ 和第四项 $b_4$ 是哪一组？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$q=-\\frac{1}{2},\\quad b_4=\\frac{5}{2}$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$q=2,\\quad b_4=-160$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$q=\\frac{1}{2},\\quad b_4=-5$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$q=\\frac{1}{2},\\quad b_4=-\\frac{5}{2}$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"一个等比数列的前两项依次为 $2\\sqrt{2},4$。它的公比 $q$ 和第四项 $b_4$ 是哪一组？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$q=\\sqrt{2},\\quad b_4=8$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$q=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}},\\quad b_4=1$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$q=2,\\quad b_4=16\\sqrt{2}$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$q=\\sqrt{2},\\quad b_4=4\\sqrt{2}$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"一个等比数列的前两项依次为 $\\frac{1}{3\\sqrt{3}},1$。它的公比 $q$ 和第四项 $b_4$ 是哪一组？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$q=\\sqrt{3},\\quad b_4=1$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$q=\\frac{1}{3\\sqrt{3}},\\quad b_4=\\frac{1}{729}$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$q=3\\sqrt{3},\\quad b_4=27$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$q=3\\sqrt{3},\\quad b_4=3\\sqrt{3}$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"等比数列的开头依次为 $y_1,y_2,24,36,54,\\ldots$。未知的前两项 $(y_1,y_2)$ 是哪一组？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$y_1=54,\\quad y_2=36$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$y_1=\\frac{32}{3},\\quad y_2=16$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$y_1=16,\\quad y_2=\\frac{32}{3}$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$y_1=0,\\quad y_2=12$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"等比数列的开头依次为 $y_1,y_2,225,-135,81,\\ldots$。未知的前两项 $(y_1,y_2)$ 是哪一组？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$y_1=625,\\quad y_2=-375$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$y_1=81,\\quad y_2=-135$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$y_1=945,\\quad y_2=585$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$y_1=625,\\quad y_2=375$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"multiple","stem":"设 $(x_n)$ 是实数等比数列，公比为 $q$，$k$ 是正整数。下列关于用两项确定公比的结论，哪些成立？选出全部成立的结论。","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"已知 $x_1,x_2$ 时，$q=\\frac{x_2}{x_1}$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"仅已知 $x_1,x_3$ 时，所有可能的公比为 $\\sqrt{\\frac{x_3}{x_1}}$ 和 $-\\sqrt{\\frac{x_3}{x_1}}$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"已知 $x_k,x_{k+1}$ 时，$q=\\frac{x_{k+1}}{x_k}$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"仅已知 $x_1,x_3$ 时，公比唯一，为 $\\sqrt{\\frac{x_3}{x_1}}$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"E","text":"已知 $x_k,x_{k+1}$ 时，$q=\\frac{x_k}{x_{k+1}}$ 对任意实数等比数列成立。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"F","text":"任意两个非零实数都能依次作为某个实数等比数列的 $x_1,x_3$。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"multiple","stem":"实数等比数列 $(a_n)$ 满足 $a_3=6$，$a_5=24$。公比 $q$、第六项 $a_6$ 和第七项 $a_7$ 可能同时取下列哪些值？选出全部可能的结果。","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$q=2,\\quad a_6=48,\\quad a_7=96$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$q=-2,\\quad a_6=-48,\\quad a_7=96$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$q=4,\\quad a_6=96,\\quad a_7=384$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$q=-2,\\quad a_6=-48,\\quad a_7=-96$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"要求实数等比数列 $(a_n)$ 同时满足 $a_6=10$ 和 $a_8=-10$。关于它的公比 $q$、第六项和第七项，下列哪一个结论成立？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$q=-1,\\quad a_6=10,\\quad a_7=-10$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"不存在满足这两个条件的实数等比数列。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$q=1,\\quad a_6=10,\\quad a_7=10$。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"multiple","stem":"实数等比数列 $(a_n)$ 满足 $a_3=-2$，$a_5=-18$。公比 $q$、第六项 $a_6$ 和第七项 $a_7$ 可能同时取下列哪些值？选出全部可能的结果。","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$q=3,\\quad a_6=-54,\\quad a_7=-162$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$q=-3,\\quad a_6=54,\\quad a_7=-162$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$q=9,\\quad a_6=-162,\\quad a_7=-1458$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$q=-3,\\quad a_6=54,\\quad a_7=162$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"实数等比数列 $(a_n)$ 满足 $a_5=24$，$a_8=3$。它的公比 $q$、第六项 $a_6$ 和第七项 $a_7$ 是哪一组？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$q=2,\\quad a_6=48,\\quad a_7=96$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$q=\\frac{1}{8},\\quad a_6=3,\\quad a_7=\\frac{3}{8}$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$q=-\\frac{1}{2},\\quad a_6=-12,\\quad a_7=6$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$q=\\frac{1}{2},\\quad a_6=12,\\quad a_7=6$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"multiple","stem":"四个数列由下面的首项与递推关系确定，$n$ 为正整数。\n\n| 数列 | 首项 | 递推关系 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $S$ | $a_1=5$ | $a_{n+1}=4a_n$ |\n| $T$ | $a_1=5$ | $a_{n+1}=4+a_n$ |\n| $U$ | $a_1=-8$ | $a_{n+1}=\\frac{1}{2}+a_n$ |\n| $V$ | $a_1=-8$ | $a_{n+1}=\\frac{1}{2}a_n$ |\n\n下列分类及公差、公比的判断，哪些成立？选出全部成立的判断。","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$S$ 是等比数列，公比为 $4$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$T$ 是等差数列，公差为 $4$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$U$ 是等差数列，公差为 $\\frac{1}{2}$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$V$ 是等比数列，公比为 $\\frac{1}{2}$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"E","text":"$S$ 是等差数列，公差为 $4$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"F","text":"$V$ 是等差数列，公差为 $\\frac{1}{2}$。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"multiple","stem":"下列数列例子及增减性判断，哪些同时符合所写的首项与公比条件？$n$ 为正整数。选出全部成立的判断。","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"条件 $b_1>0,\\ q>1$：$b_n=2^{n-1}$ 是增数列。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"条件 $b_1>0,\\ 0<q<1$：$b_n=(\\frac{1}{2})^{n-1}$ 是减数列。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"条件 $b_1<0,\\ q>1$：$b_n=-2^{n-1}$ 是减数列。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"条件 $b_1<0,\\ 0<q<1$：$b_n=-(\\frac{1}{2})^{n-1}$ 是增数列。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"E","text":"条件 $b_1<0,\\ q>1$：$b_n=-3^{n-1}$ 是增数列。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"F","text":"条件 $b_1<0,\\ 0<q<1$：$b_n=-(\\frac{1}{3})^{n-1}$ 是减数列。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"在实数范围内，表达式 $\\sqrt{2x-3}+\\sqrt{3-2x}$ 的完整定义域是哪一个集合？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$[\\frac{3}{2},+\\infty)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$\\{\\frac{3}{2}\\}$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$(-\\infty,\\frac{3}{2}]$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$\\mathbb{R}$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"在实数范围内，表达式 $\\sqrt{6x}-\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{5x+1}}$ 的完整定义域是哪一个集合？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$[0,+\\infty)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$[-\\frac{1}{5},+\\infty)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$(-\\frac{1}{5},+\\infty)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$(0,+\\infty)$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"在实数范围内，表达式 $\\frac{1}{x^2-3x}+\\sqrt{7-4x}$ 的完整定义域是哪一个集合？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$(-\\infty,\\frac{7}{4}]$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$(-\\infty,0)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$(-\\infty,0)\\cup(0,\\frac{7}{4})$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$(-\\infty,0)\\cup(0,\\frac{7}{4}]$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"在实数范围内，表达式 $\\frac{4}{x^2-16}-\\sqrt{10-2x}$ 的完整定义域是哪一个集合？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$(-\\infty,-4)\\cup(-4,4)\\cup(4,5]$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$(-\\infty,5]$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$(-\\infty,-4)\\cup(-4,4)\\cup(4,5)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$(-\\infty,-4)\\cup(4,5]$","figure_ids":[]}]}}],"new_figures":[]}
